# Build the channel-signature fixture on out/fx: per track, load SIGn into
# the track's own slot (LOAD FILE, gated on the name), set FX1 and FX2 to
# NONE (20 UPs clamp the list at NONE; tests/build-sig-fixture.sh reads the
# published FX ids back to prove it), set LOOP and TSTR to OFF on the SRC
# SETUP page (☠ push the knob WHILE turning: a plain turn is ignored there;
# gated on "AUTO" leaving the page), then in grid recording place a trig on
# step 1 (gated on its lamp) and FUNC+TRIG it into a one-shot. Save, PLAY.
# ☠ Waits are GUEST time. FX must be NONE: with the defaults (FLTR, DELAY)
# the USB stream is the readback arena times 63/64, not sample-exact, so the
# fidelity oracle only holds on a dry track.
